# tally 2.1.8 item 77 (item 15 of the third turn; the review's G2, g2_words): ob is a decision, so its refusal
# reads RUN-PLACE ob takes pot below 0, naming no balance; every day of oa's window prints those bytes, so the
# plain line is that refusal (pick P30), as each pin is (d4..d6). 435db654 compared the balances and printed the
# hole for d1 and d2.
# tally 2.2 (2.2-4): the clause `windows each` is cut; its asks are the plain line, the hole with each unknown day it
# carries named (`unknown day:`, 2.2-11). A caller who takes the window as one day pins its cell.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind savings: place PLN min 0
place pot: savings lives 2025-01-01..
place jar: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place box: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
input wa: date
input db: date
input small: money PLN
input amt2: money PLN

move oa: transfers
  on wa
  leg cash from pot to jar amount small

move ob: transfers
  on db
  when bal(box) >= 0.00 PLN
  reads box
  leg cash from pot to world amount amt2

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  small = 10.00 PLN "s"
  amt2 = 200.00 PLN "s"
  wa = window(2026-04-05, 2026-04-10) "s"
  db = 2026-04-07 "s"
  opening[pot] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[jar] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[box] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask d1: bal(pot, 2026-04-30)
ask d2: flows(ob, 2026-04)
ask d3: bal(jar, 2026-04-30)
ask d4: bal(pot, 2026-04-30)
ask d5: bal(pot, 2026-04-30) with wa = 2026-04-05
ask d6: bal(pot, 2026-04-30) with wa = 2026-04-10
ask d7: bal(jar, 2026-04-30) with wa = 2026-04-05
ask d8: bal(jar, 2026-04-30) with wa = 2026-04-10
=== expect
d1: refused: RUN-PLACE ob takes pot below 0
  cut 2026-01-01
d2: refused: RUN-PLACE ob takes pot below 0
  cut 2026-01-01
d3: 10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
d4: refused: RUN-PLACE ob takes pot below 0
  cut 2026-01-01
d5: refused: RUN-PLACE ob takes pot below 0
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-05
  cut 2026-01-01
d6: refused: RUN-PLACE ob takes pot below 0
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-10
  cut 2026-01-01
d7: 10.00 PLN
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-05
  cut 2026-01-01
d8: 10.00 PLN
  pinned: wa = 2026-04-10
  cut 2026-01-01
